                <pb facs="1219" n="1207" sameAs="frus:frus1944v03/pg1207"/>

                <note rend="inline" type="source">841.79658/66: Telegram</note>
                <head>
                    <hi rendition="#italic">The Secretary of State to the
                        Minister in Sweden</hi> (<hi rendition="#italic"
                            >Johnson</hi>)</head>
                <opener>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right">
                        <placeName>
                            <hi rendition="#small-caps">Washington</hi></placeName>, <date
                            calendar="gregorian" when="1944-01-13T11:00:00-04:00">January 13,
                            1944—11 a.m.</date>
                    </dateline>
                </opener>
                <p>61. Without jeopardizing possibility of favorable action by Swedish Government,
                    please endeavor to expedite final decision on subject matter of your 23, January
                    4.</p>
                <closer>
                    <signed>
                        <hi rendition="#small-caps">Hull</hi>
                    </signed>
                </closer>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
